h3.mb-3(translate) Shell

.form-line(*ngIf='isConPTYAvailable')
    .header
        .title(translate) Use bundled ConPTY
        .description(translate) Uses the newer ConPTY from Windows Terminal

    toggle(
        [(ngModel)]='config.store.terminal.useConPTY',
        (ngModelChange)='config.save()'
    )

.alert.alert-info.d-flex.align-items-center(*ngIf='config.store.terminal.useConPTY && isConPTYAvailable && !isBundledConPTYAvailable')
    .me-auto(translate) Windows 10 2004 (build 19041) or above is required for the bundled ConPTY
